{"4318080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ALTEREDBLOOD+ [AB+]", "steam_appid": 4318080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECKON OUR EXTINCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3242 CE</strong>:</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We launched MOTHER, a self-replicating megastructure towards the galactic centre.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>4,199,245,344,263,242,348,389,893,582,349,373 CE:</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MOTHER has consumed 99.99999997% of the Observable Universe.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The remnants of humanity dwell in the remaining space, harvesting and living off MOTHER’s blood.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MOTHER created you to stop them.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/f37d4429463f9e95f5c663ee6b06ee09.poster.avif?t=1785721377\" width=720 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/f37d4429463f9e95f5c663ee6b06ee09.webm?t=1785721377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/f37d4429463f9e95f5c663ee6b06ee09.mp4?t=1785721377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BLOOD = SAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALTEREDBLOOD+ (AB+) is a fast-paced Movement-FPS about Painting levels in your enemies’ Blood, awakening your weapon’s abilities, and using their unique interactions with Blood to create powerful setups and combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> SPLATTER | SOAK | AWAKEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/65e0b8ba1fbd05a156f0d2899f15cc55.webp?t=1785721377\" width=750 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/b3627de4ef2a3eea35342d0a93a63daf.poster.avif?t=1785721377\" width=720 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/b3627de4ef2a3eea35342d0a93a63daf.webm?t=1785721377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/b3627de4ef2a3eea35342d0a93a63daf.mp4?t=1785721377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SPLATTER </strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks blast SAP onto surfaces behind enemies. Enemies explode into Gibs, spreading more SAP. Saturate the arena with SAP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SOAK</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand in their SAP or Bathe in their Gibs to awaken your weapons and abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>AWAKEN</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalate the slaughter: when Awakened, your weapons gain powerful effects and unique interactions with SAP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FEED</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEE-</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>More details coming soon!</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by movement tech in classic FPS in <i>Source Engine games</i> and <i>Quake</i>, ALTEREDBLOOD+ features a wide range of techniques to learn and master: <i>B-hopping, Air-Strafing, Surfing, Trimping, Rocket jumping, etc.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Modernised controls are available as settings.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>More details coming soon!</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a brood of passionate artists, designers, and developers. Say hi! We don't bite unless you want us to :&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4318080/extras/53f3baecee20bd77e2e7c4a33f98d742.avif?t=1785721377\" width=750 height=192 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECKON OUR EXTINCTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>3242 CE</strong>:</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We launched MOTHER, a self-replicating megastructure towards the galactic centre.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>4,199,245,344,263,242,348,389,893,582,349,373 CE:</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>MOTHER has consumed 99.99999997% of the Observable Universe.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The remnants of humanity dwell in the remaining space, harvesting and living off MOTHER’s blood.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MOTHER created you to stop them.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu