 SAP onto surfaces behind enemies. Enemies explode into Gibs, spreading more SAP. Saturate the arena with SAP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SOAK</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand in their SAP or Bathe in their Gibs to awaken your weapons and abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>AWAKEN</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalate the slaughter: when Awakened, your weapons gain powerful effects and unique interactions with SAP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FEED</strong></i> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEED MOTHER, MOTHER IS HUNGRY, FEE-</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>More details coming soon!</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by movement tech in classic FPS in <i>Source Engine games</i> and <i>Quake</i>, ALTEREDBLOOD+ features a wide range of techniques to learn and master: <i>B-hopping, Air-Strafing, Surfing, Trimping, Rocket jumping, etc.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Modernised controls are available as settings.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>More details coming soon!</i></strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a brood of passionate artists, designers, and developers. Say hi! We don't bite unless you want us to :&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"